        </h2>
      
    </div>
    
      <div class="rich-text__text rte  rte__container">
        <p>SHEEX® makes top-quality cooling bedding and sleepwear which is why we offer a 60-Night Risk-Free Guarantee*. If for any reason you need to return your SHEEX product that was purchased from SHEEX.com, simply follow the below instructions.<br/></p>
