        <div class="image-with-text__media 16/9"><img src="//www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=1536" alt="" srcset="//www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=360 360w, //www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=535 535w, //www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=720 720w, //www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=940 940w, //www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=1070 1070w, //www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=1200 1200w, //www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/files/Easy_Returns_with_a_Smile.jpg?v=1761672070&amp;width=1400 1400w" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) calc((50vw - 64px)), calc((100vw - 40px))">
</div>
 
        <div class="image-with-text__content image-with-text__content--left image-with-text__content--image_right"><h2 class="image-with-text__heading h3">
              Returns
            </h2>
            <div class="image-with-text__text richtext__content bannerTxt">
              <p>We make exceptional products and fully stand behind their quality. However, if you are unsatisfied with your purchase for any reason, we will gladly accept returns and exchanges within  60 nights  of the purchase date. Returns are refunded in the original payment form. SHEEX cannot accept returns after  60  nights for any reason other than manufacturer defects  (see criteria below).</p><p>Gift cards and international purchases are not eligible for returns. If you were the recipient of a product as a gift, returns shall be honored if requested within sixty (60) nights of the original purchase and refunds shall be issued in the form of store credit or to the payment method used in the original purchase.</p><p>To initiate a return to SHEEX.com, simply click the Easy Product Returns icon below. </p>
            </div>
          
 
          
 
          
            
  <a
    
      href="https://www.sheex.com/apps/returns"
      data-button-text="Easy Product Returns"
    
    class="button button--primary button--small image-with-text__button focus-inset"
    
    aria-label="Easy Product Returns"
  >
    <span>
      Easy Product Returns
    </span>
  </a>


</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
 
</div><section id="shopify-section-template--23112336375946__rich_text_NQzitH" class="shopify-section spaced-section"><link href="//www.sheex.com/cdn/shop/t/606/assets/section-rich-text.css?v=109255932849255509681793658399" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />
<style data-shopify>#shopify-section-template--23112336375946__rich_text_NQzitH {

  padding-top: 0;



  padding-bottom: 0;

}
.bannerTxt {
    font-size: 14px;
}
@media screen and (min-width: 750px) { #shopify-section-template--23112336375946__rich_text_NQzitH {

  padding-top: 0;



  padding-bottom: 0;

} }

</style><div class="rich-text container">
  <div class="rich-text__wrapper rich-text__wrapper--column">
    <div class="rich-text__title">
      
      
    </div>
    
      <div class="rich-text__text rte  rte__container">
        <p>You will need the email address or the SHEEX order number and the shipping address zip code used to place the order. </p><p>If you experience any issues with the online return request form, please email: <a href="mailto:RETURNS@SHEEX.COM">RETURNS@SHEEX.COM</a> to request a return label. Please allow up to 10 business days for the refund to be credited to your original payment method.</p><p>Please include the following information in the email to <a href="mailto:RETURNS@SHEEX.COM">RETURNS@SHEEX.COM</a>;</p><ul><li>The purchase order number</li><li>The product(s) you are returning</li><li>The reason for the return</li></ul><p><span style="text-decoration:underline"><strong>Exchange Policy</strong></span></p><p>We're so confident that you'll love our sheets, we welcome you to try them out, risk-free, for 60-nights.</p><p>You have 60-nights from the date of purchase to exchange any item purchased on SHEEX.COM</p><p>If you’d like to purchase a different color or item, you may return the original item in accordance with our return policy and place a new order.</p><p>SALE section items may not be returned or exchanged. ALL SALES ARE FINAL.</p><p>New orders are not eligible for any discounts or promotions that were applied to the original order.</p><p>Orders being shipped to Canada are subject to duties and taxes at the consumer's expense. SHEEX can only provide estimated duties and taxes on Canadian orders. The consumer is responsible for all duties and taxes upon delivery.  Customer is also responsible for the cost of return shipping.</p><p>Exchanges are shipped as soon as possible following receipt of your original item. Be sure to include all original packaging and contents in order expedite your exchange.</p><p>Please note that we do not accept returns, exchanges or warranty claims of items purchased from third-party retailers. We recommend getting in touch with any third-party retailer directly for information on their exchange policies.</p><p><span style="text-decoration:underline"><strong>Warranty Coverage:</strong></span></p><p>The SHEEX Product Warranty covers all defects as defined below for one (1) year following purchase of the product from SHEEX unless otherwise noted on product tags or packaging. This one (1) year warranty stays with the original date of purchase by the original purchaser and owner:</p><p><strong>What is NOT Covered:</strong></p><ul><li>Normal wear and tear.</li><li>Any improper use of the product.</li><li>Minor imperfections such as slight cosmetic flaws.</li><li>Stains, tears, burns, and discoloration that occur over time and/or are caused by you.</li><li>Personal opinions or preferences regarding the softness, firmness, smoothness, or attributes of the product.</li><li>Any product(s) purchased or acquired used, resold, gifted or anyway not in possession of the original owner.</li><li>Any product(s) purchased not from SHEEX or a non-authorized SHEEX distributor.</li><li>Physical damage to the product caused by you.</li><li>Allergies or sensitivities to SHEEX Performance Fabrics (known as fabrics going forward) or materials or scents.</li><li>Damage caused by insects, animals, rodents, or children.</li><li>Naturally occurring aromas from polyester, spandex, TENCEL™ Lyocell, memory foam or any other materials used in our products.</li><li>Damage from improper cleaning methods or improper cleaning materials.</li><li>SHEEX reNEWed Products, all sales are final. </li><li>FINAL SALE section product may not be returned or exchanged. *</li></ul><p>* Shipping costs cannot be refunded. </p><p>* Please note that we do not accept returns or exchanges of items purchased from third-party retailers. We recommend getting in touch with any third-party retailer directly for information on their return policies<br/><br/><span style="text-decoration:underline"><strong>Mattress Warranty Coverage:</strong></span></p><p>Covered Defects: The following shall be considered as a defective (collectively “Defects”) product should your product meet the below criteria as determined solely by us:</p><ul><li>Visible indentation or sag of mattresses greater than one (1) inch that is not a result of improper use, an improper bed, bed base or foundation, including caused by the use of flexing or bowed slats.</li><li>A physical flaw in the construction of the product, such as fabric tearing or stitch unraveling, that does not result from improper use. </li></ul><p>Additional <a href="https://www.sheex.com/pages/sheex-performance-cooling-mattresses-warranty">SHEEX® Mattresses warranty information can be found linked here.</a></p><p><span style="text-decoration:underline"><strong>Defective Items</strong></span></p><p>If you’ve received a defective item, please contact Customer Service by phone, 856-334-3021, by emailing, <a href="mailto:CustomerService@SHEEX.com">CustomerService@SHEEX.com</a>, or by using the “Live Chat” feature on our website for assistance and we will provide you with a prepaid return label.</p><p>Please be sure to have the following information available:</p><ul><li>The purchase order number</li><li>Photographs of the defective or damaged item displaying the SHEEX tags</li><li>Did you notice the damage over time, or did it happen all at once?</li></ul><p><span style="text-decoration:underline"><strong>Your Defective Item Warranty Remedy</strong></span></p><p>SHEEX® has sole discretion to determine if your Defect is legitimate as per this Limited Warranty.  If the product is found to be defective, your sole remedy will be a replacement of your product with a comparable size, color and model. Should your size, color and/or model be discontinued or out-of-stock, we will provide the most comparable product available as a replacement at our discretion. </p><p><span style="text-decoration:underline"><strong>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, WE AND/OR SUPPLIERS MAKE NO REPRESENTATIONS, WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, BEYOND THOSE SET FORTH IN THIS WARRANTY AND IN OUR MARKETING MATERIALS. EACH OF THOSE PARTIES DISCLAIMS ANY AND ALL WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS, EXPRESS, STATUTORY, AND IMPLIED. SOME JURISDICTIONS DO NOT ALLOW THE LIMITATION OR EXCLUSION OF CERTAIN WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS, SO SOME OF THE ABOVE EXCLUSIONS MAY NOT APPLY TO YOU. THERE ARE NO WARRANTIES THAT EXTEND BEYOND THE FACE OF THIS CONTRACT AND OUR TOTAL LIABILITY SHALL NOT EXCEED THE PURCHASE PRICE PAID FOR THE PRODUCT.</strong></span></p>
      </div>
    
  </div>
</div>


